{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44807","headline":"丹阳浦送客之海上 · 法振","name":"丹阳浦送客之海上","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"不到终南向几秋，移居更欲近沧洲。\n风吹雨色连村暗，潮拥菱花出岸浮。\n漠漠望中春自艳，寥寥泊处夜堪愁。\n如君岂得空高枕，只益天书遣远求。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"法振","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44807.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44807","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}